# Only post_upgrade. On a first install there is nothing running to restart,
# and a message telling the user to restart something they have not started yet
# is noise that teaches them to ignore the next one.
post_upgrade() {
    cat <<'EOF'

>>> Restart textract to finish the upgrade:

      systemctl --user restart textract

    KWin authorises screen capture by matching the running process's executable
    against the installed desktop entry. This upgrade replaced that binary, so a
    daemon started beforehand keeps running from a deleted file and every
    capture will fail with NoAuthorized until it is restarted.

EOF
}
